{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find object, take it, check its properties. Move to object if needed. Search object area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = SearchObjectArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
